HedronOS \r (\l)

  A gaming-first Linux distribution: your GPU driver was picked before this screen drew.
  No version here on purpose — \r is the kernel, and `hedronctl status` prints the image build,
  because a banner that repeats the release string is a banner that gets left behind by one.

  Sign in, then:

    hedronctl status      what the machine is doing right now
    hedron-doctor status  why it is not doing what you asked
    hstore list           what you can install

